cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "sovereign-rating-lab: Sovereign Credit Rating Migration and Prediction Lab"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible research toolkit for sovereign credit rating analysis.
  It builds country-year-agency rating panels on a unified 1-21 rating scale,
  estimates annual rating migration matrices and upgrade/downgrade
  probabilities, studies macroeconomic drivers with panel fixed-effects models
  and clustered standard errors, trains ordinal Logit/Probit, random forest and
  XGBoost forecasting models under time-series cross-validation with SHAP
  explanations, and provides an event-study framework for sovereign spreads,
  exchange rates and equity indices. Ships with a Streamlit dashboard,
  reproducible reports, and a CI pipeline.
type: software
